        "bodySample": "Blue Triangle Announcements Dec 18, 2025 12:33 AM Release Notes - Portal v9.11.0 Bug Fixes Fixed an issue where the TTI portal term wasn’t applying correctly Fixed an issue where the native filters weren’t working as expected on the Revenue Calculator page Fixed an issue on the Errors Explorer page where sites with a high volume of errors could cause the page to not render properly. To resolve this, we added a minimum count filter. Fixed an issue where adding certain Native App metrics on the custom widget in the dashboard would cause the widget to fail to load Fixed an issue where the monetary unit wasn’t being decoded properly on the custom widget in the dashboard Fixed an issue on the Native App Performance Details page where selecting a page name bar graph wouldn’t load the data properly Fixed an issue on the Native App preconfigured dashboards where clicking on the globe to link to another page wasn’t including the proper OS Fixed an issue on the Synthetic Performance Details page"
