esktop on the page Checkout Shopping Cart Real User Monitoring Minor Clear Aug 18 02:23 AM Real User Anomaly Detected in Redirect Hourly Trend Desktop on the page My Account Real User Monitoring Minor Clear Aug 18 01:23 AM Real User Anomaly Detected in Base Page Hourly Trend Desktop on the page Checkout Real User Monitoring 1 to 10 (62) 5 / page 10 / page 25 / page 50 / page 100 / page 250 / page 500 / page All Blue Triangle Announcements Dec 18, 2025 12:33 AM Release Notes - Portal v9.11.0 Bug Fixes Fixed an issue where the TTI portal term wasn’t applying correctly Fixed an issue where the native filters weren’t working as expected on the Revenue Calculator page Fixed an issue on the Errors Explorer page where sites with a high volume of errors could cause the page to not render properly. To resolve this, we added a minimum count filter. Fixed an issue where adding certain Native App metrics on the custom widget in the dashboard would cause the widget to fail to load Fixed an issue where the monetary unit wasn’t being decoded properly on the custom widget in the dashboard Fixed an issue on the Native App Performance Details page where selecting a page name bar graph wouldn’t load the data properly Fixed an issue on the Native App preconfigured dashboards where clicking on the globe to link to another page wasn’t including the proper OS Fixed an issue on the Synthetic Performance Details page where low volume sites could cause the previous/next buttons on the scatterplot and the function that runs when clicking on the performance details line graph to break Added a Minimum (X) Load time filter on the Revenue Calculator and Revenue Opportunity pages to help tune the graphs Fixed an issue where the Revenue Opportunity roll up numbers wouldn’t match the table data in certain instances Fixed an issue where non-latin characters could break the device model filter Fixed an issue where Aternity partners were unable to load the RUM Performance Overview Fixed an issue where 